{
  "slug": "resolve-ai",
  "name": "Resolve Ai",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Use Resolve for investigations, incidents, and production context.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **13 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (13): `alerts` (List and filter alerts in Resolve), `apply-fix` (Turn a Resolve investigation's root-cause findings into code changes in your local repo), `ask` (Send Resolve a question or a request to investigate — continuing an existing chat or investigation, or starting…), `chats` (List recent Resolve chats), `create-skill` (Write or tune a skill for the Resolve plugin — encoding workflow guidance, not tool API details), `demo` (Run a guided, self-paced tour of Resolve using the connected org's live data — surface the environment, resume…), `feedback` (Send Resolve your feedback — on an investigation's root cause, a chat answer, or the Resolve experience itself), `help-resolve` (Introduce Resolve (the AI DevOps investigation platform) and route the user to the right next step — investigate,…), and 5 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `resolve`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install resolve-ai@claude-community` from `resolve-ai-oss/resolve-ai-plugins` (`plugins/claude/resolve-ai`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
